<title>INDIA: India's Baroda Rayon 1996/97 loss.</title>
<headline>India's Baroda Rayon 1996/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		  227.73   vs     79.55</p>
<p>    Net sales	     2,733.42   vs  3,450.01</p>
<p>    Other income	     58.90   vs     90.80</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   2,616.25   vs  3,225.67</p>
<p>    Interest costs	  261.10   vs    246.32</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    142.60   vs    148.16</p>
<p>    Tax			   0.10   vs	0.20</p>
<p>Note: The Baroda Rayon Corporation Ltd said in a statement that its turnover and overall performance had suffered as it was not able to achieve full production levels, due to the non-availability of adequate working capital.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
